The '''SOS Flare''' is an {{Epic}} [[Deployables|Deployable]]. It is unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Blaze Slayer VII}} and is the final form of the {{Item|Warning Flare}}. Healing effect only working on [[Crimson Isle]] and [[Kuudra]].

